 "what": "The printed values of the long dimension labels (bound PRIMARY to a span of at least 55 px) on each development house's selected plan copy, transcribed by eye from local crops of the publisher's plans (never committed), as text facts: frame, box in that frame's pixels, the pass that reads the label upright, the printed value and what the frozen 005D reader read in that pass. FIT labels may calibrate the numeric reader; HELD_BACK labels only check a calibration; TARGET labels are the round-4 houses and never fit anything. Excluded regions are listed with the reason.",
 "notes": [
  "rarytasy-eoze: the overall printed 1600 was read 1601 (two touching zeros cut through the second one); 005A and 005D recorded 1601 as the printed value — that record is corrected here.",
  "alt-marcowki publishes its plan mirrored: no label reads in any rotation; it has no ground truth.",
  "galaktyka: the one long-span region on its selected copy is a plant symbol, not a label."
 ],
